WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:06,540
Who said I can't get along with Lu Ling and other second-generation losers?

2
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:09,340
Lu Ling, didn’t she make a special trip to ask her friends to invite me?

3
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:10,940
Let's go and eat first

4
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:14,330
It was indeed my mistake to tell Mu Yi Aimei

5
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:16,330
But if I can get on the line with Lu Ling

6
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:19,330
I am not worried about my future career and no one will cry.

7
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,400
more than two hours

8
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,800
This can be considered as a collection of the seven Choose You novels written by Jiang Xucheng before.

9
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:41,100
That guy didn't even say a word to me when he left.

10
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:44,300
Grandma, you are talking about Jiang Xucheng

11
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:49,190
This guy usually comes to see me once a week

12
00:00:49,190 --> 00:00:51,190
I also told him to just come and live with me.

13
00:00:51,190 --> 00:00:53,190
He refused to listen and insisted on living alone.

14
00:00:53,190 --> 00:00:55,190
His body is inconvenient

15
00:00:55,190 --> 00:00:56,190
Still refuse to hire a nanny

16
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:58,190
The houses nearby are as messy as a chicken coop.

17
00:00:58,190 --> 00:01:00,190
Grandma Li, I’ll be fine on Sunday

18
00:01:00,190 --> 00:01:02,190
Why don't I go to his house for you?
